---

# Project settings; never put credentials in this file.
base: origin/main
model: deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash
reasoning-enabled: true
reasoning-exclude: true
reasoning-max-tokens: 8192
max-tokens: 131072
max-diff-chars: 0
timeout-seconds: 1500
user-prompt: |
  Please review the following code changes.
  Write all review explanations in English, regardless of the language used in the code or comments.
  Your job is to review the changes in the PR and those changes only. Do not widen the scope of the review or suggest major refactorings.
  Focus on the major findings, do not overly polish. Point out parts that are hard to read for a human.
  Focus on the actual code changes, not the tests. Review the tests for completeness and functionality but do not polish them.
